{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e18-scene-21",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "淳于乔留下的流程价值  (The Lasting Value of Chun Yuqiao's System)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "After the charity specials completely clear the talk show's name, Xingtian's chairwoman praises the editorial team to Chun Yuqiao and commends Bu Xiaogu in person. Listen to Chun Yuqiao and Xiaogu in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当初进星天的时候，我跟你约定过一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要为公司打造一个可以独立运行的机制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这也是我四年以来的工作目的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在一切证明，总编室包括整个星天，已经不必再依靠我了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总算是不负你所望，我可以交差了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢你这些年的信任。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐和凯文哥，我们几个的能力确实不差。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是我认为，这次危机处理的成功说明了另一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "它证明的不是我们的能力，而是淳于总留下的流程价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们大家都盼着淳于总早日回到星天。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当初进星天的时候，我跟你约定过一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I first joined Xingtian, I made an agreement with you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要为公司打造一个可以独立运行的机制。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I promised to build a mechanism for the company that could run independently.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这也是我四年以来的工作目的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'That has been the goal of my work over the past four years.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在一切证明，总编室包括整个星天，已经不必再依靠我了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everything now proves that the chief editor office and all of Xingtian no longer need to rely on me.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总算是不负你所望，我可以交差了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'At last I have lived up to your trust and can consider my mission complete.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢你这些年的信任。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Thank you for trusting me all these years.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chairwoman, does this now prove what I told you earlier?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingtian's chief editor team truly is the most capable team in the industry.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐和凯文哥，我们几个的能力确实不差。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Sister Xingzi, Brother Kaiwen, and I are certainly capable enough.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是我认为，这次危机处理的成功说明了另一件事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'However, I believe the success of this crisis response proves something else.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "它证明的不是我们的能力，而是淳于总留下的流程价值。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What it proves is not our personal ability, rather the value of the workflow Mr Chun Yuqiao left behind.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们大家都盼着淳于总早日回到星天。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'All of us hope Mr Chun Yuqiao will return to Xingtian soon.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "当初进星天的时候，我跟你约定过一件事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我要为公司打造一个可以独立运行的机制。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "这也是我四年以来的工作目的。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "现在一切证明，总编室包括整个星天，已经不必再依靠我了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "总算是不负你所望，我可以交差了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "谢谢你这些年的信任。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "董事长，现在可以证明我说过的话了吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "星天总编室团队确实是业内最有能力的团队。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐和凯文哥，我们几个的能力确实不差。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "但是我认为，这次危机处理的成功说明了另一件事。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "它证明的不是我们的能力，而是淳于总留下的流程价值。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我们大家都盼着淳于总早日回到星天。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "While Chun Yuqiao feels his four-year mission to build a self-sufficient team is fulfilled, Xiaogu reminds the chairwoman that their triumph proves the lasting value of his workflow. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "下次见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
